_id":"WrYoTcyZLmezgbzwiAg9cw","review_id":"jccdkY8QRZizz96bhqbkzg","date":"2018-12-08T04:21:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9185512065887451,"text_excerpt":"So what's the person who doesn't eat pork doing reviewing this spot? I was in charge of ordering and acquiring a ham for an out of town relative. Ordering online was super easy and you don't pay until you pick up. I was sort of concerned about the amount of time it would take to pick up, the day before Thanksgiving. But they were super organized and since I went around 9am, I was in and out in less 15 minutes. The staff was hustling and it was easy. Bonus my family loved the ham."},{"business_id":"WrYoTcyZLmezgbzwiAg9cw","review_id":"RsZqUqEsuSGZu84m22q1FA","date":"2015-11-27T23:00:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8919916749000549,"text_excerpt":"For the past two thanksgivings, honey baked ham company has been there for me and my tummy! Last year, we went all out, ordering a full thanksgiving dinner, complete with succulent honey baked ham, smoked turkey, mac and cheese, mashed potatoes, and stuffing. All the meat is precooked and just requires you to heat it up (I vote for the oven over the microwave). The side dishes do require a bit of cooking before they're ready though, but there are great directions that are easy to follow. It was amazing and wonderful and tasty of course, the only impediment for me doing the same this year was the cost (the cost of quality) and my personal desire to try and cook some homemade foods for than..."},{"business_id":"WrYoTcyZLmezgbzwiAg9cw","review_id":"wnEbyATqpJgQELjvnuR-bg","date":"2013-12-27T07:41:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8840595483779907,"text_excerpt":"Honeybaked ham has become a must for me on Christmas, this year that tradition continued and wow was it good. The ham was juicy with just the right mix of sweetness to spice in the crust. Always a must for me and my family and the service at this location was swift and friendly."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
